{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive VR training for CTE.</strong> GWPro helps students safely practice job-ready skills, connect theory to real-world scenarios, and build confidence before entering labs, job sites, or work-based learning programs.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why CTE Teachers Choose GWPro</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CTE-Aligned VR Modules covering safety, skilled trades, healthcare, and career exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Safe, Risk-Free Practice \u2014 students learn by doing, without real-world consequences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Standards-Based Content aligned with industry safety and certification frameworks\u00a0(OSHA/NEBOSH)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for Classrooms with teacher-led multiplayer and individual practice modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built-In Assessment Support using \u201cLook-Fors\u201d to observe and evaluate key skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High Engagement for today\u2019s digital-native learners</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to Use</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Works with major VR headsets (Meta, Pico, HTC, DPVR)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One-button setup \u2014 no prior VR experience required</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trusted by CTE programs worldwide to improve engagement, safety, and workforce readiness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Global Workforce VR Career Training</strong> includes:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Arc Flash (Office)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Arc Flash (Pump Station)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Confined Space Entry</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Electrical Safety (Type 1 Switchgear)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Electrical Safety (Type 2 Switchgear)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6. Fire Safety (Office)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7. Fire Safety (Workshop)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8. First Aid</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9. Forklift Hazard Recognition</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10. Forklift Pre-operational Inspection</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >11. Hot Work</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12. Load Slinging</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >13. Lockout Tagout (LOTO)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14. Maintenance Safety (Pipes and Acids)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15. Personal Protective Equipment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16. Risk Assessment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >17. Road accident with dangerous goods</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18. Scaffolding (Bakers Scaffolding Assembly)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >19. Scaffolding (Wedge Lock Scaffolding Assembly Training)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20. Trenching and Excavation (Field Work)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >21. Trenching and Excavation (Road Construction)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >22. Truck preparation for driving</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >23. Underground roof fall hazard assessment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >24. Work at height</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25. Workplace safety</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All VR Training consists of 3 modes: <strong>Study, Training, Exam</strong>, providing step-by-step control of all VR activities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Language support:</strong> English, Bahasa Melayu (\u0628\u0647\u0627\u0633 \u0645\u0644\u0627\u064a\u0648), \u010ce\u0161tina, Deutsch, Espa\u00f1ol, Fran\u00e7ais, Italiano, Latvie\u0161u, Nederlands, Polski, Portugu\u00eas, Sloven\u010dina, Svenska, Ti\u1ebfng Vi\u1ec7t, T\u00fcrk\u00e7e, \u0627\u064e\u0644\u0652\u0639\u064e\u0631\u064e\u0628\u0650\u064a\u064e\u0651\u0629\u064f, \u0641\u0627\u0631\u0633\u06cc, \u666e\u901a\u8bdd (\u4e2d\u56fd\u5927\u9646), \u65e5\u672c\u8a9e, \ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4, \u09ac\u09be\u0982\u09b2\u09be (\u09ad\u09be\u09b0\u09a4), \u0a97\u0ac1\u0a9c\u0ab0\u0abe\u0aa4\u0ac0 (\u0aad\u0abe\u0ab0\u0aa4), \u0939\u093f\u0928\u094d\u0926\u0940 (\u092d\u093e\u0930\u0924), \u0c95\u0ca8\u0ccd\u0ca8\u0ca1 (\u0cad\u0cbe\u0cb0\u0ca4), \u092e\u0930\u093e\u0920\u0940 (\u092d\u093e\u0930\u0924) and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Start your VR-powered CTE training today!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1973950?t=1770774551","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1973950?t=1770774551","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973950/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770774551","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973950/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770774551","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive VR training for CTE.</strong> GWPro helps students safely practice job-ready skills, connect theory to real-world scenarios, and build confidence before entering labs, job sites, or work-based learning programs.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why CTE Teachers Choose GWPro</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CTE-Aligned VR Modules covering safety, skilled trades, healthcare, and career exploration</p></li><li